      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im a property manager in phoenix and im dealing with a tenant who says their bedroom isnt getting cold at all. the ac unit is running constantly but that one room stays warm. what are some common reasons why this happens?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
